      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Optimal shoulder function is achieved through segmental activation along the kinetic chain. Alterations within the kinetic chain often contribute to shoulder injury. Therefore, a multi-factorial approach to shoulder rehabilitation, where the causes of shoulder pain as well as site of symptoms, should be implemented."},
